# NetworkManager runs Tacit's networking. systemd's own preset (90-systemd.preset) also turned on systemd-networkd,
# its wait-online (two minutes of waiting at every start that asked for the network) and systemd-homed at the first
# boot of every install; a lower number wins. systemd-resolved stays as it is.
disable systemd-networkd.service
disable systemd-networkd.socket
disable systemd-networkd-wait-online.service
disable systemd-homed.service
